Subject: [PATCH 10/11] dt-bindings: memory: mediatek: Add MT6789 SMI
 compatibles

Document mediatek,mt6789-smi-common and mediatek,mt6789-smi-larb
compatibles in the MediaTek SMI devicetree bindings.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/memory-controllers/mediatek,smi-common.yaml        | 2 ++
 .../bindings/memory-controllers/mediatek,smi-larb.yaml          | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/memory-controllers/mediatek,smi-common.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/memory-controllers/mediatek,smi-common.yaml
index 33c989f7f..83c432268 100644
